    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d281">

                <pb facs="0502" n="442" sameAs="frus:frus1868p2/pg442"/>

                <head>Mr. Plumb to Mr.
                        Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 97.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">City of Mexico,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1868-03-30"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >March</hi> 30, 1868.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to transmit here with
                    translation of the discourses pronounced by the President of the republic and
                    the president of congress at the closing of the first period of the sessions of
                    that body, which took place yesterday.</p>
                <p>The expectations that have been entertained of the adoption of important measures
                    during the session now closed do not appear to have been realized.</p>
                <p>Congress meets again in a further session, limited by the constitution to sixty
                    days, on the 1st proximo.</p>
                <p>I am, sir, very respectfully, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>E. L. PLUMB.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State, Washington, D. C.</hi></p>
                </postscript>



                <xi:include href="d281-a1.xml" xpointer="d281-a1"/>
            </div>
